<title>GERMANY: German May wholesale sales fall 6.2 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>German May wholesale sales fall 6.2 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal</p>
<p>Statistics Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p> GERMAN WHOLESALE SALES	May 97     April 97	May 96</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr change (unadj,pct)   -6.2     +7.0 (+6.6)    -3.9</p>
<p> Index (adj, base 1991)	  94.3    106.8 (106.4)  100.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Year-on-year figures are unadjusted. All figures are real. Previously announced data in brackets. The statistics office did not publish month-on-month adjusted figures. Figures released initially were rounded to the nearest full decimal. The nominal fall was four percent.</p>
<p>-- Bonn Newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
</text>
